<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#173B4D">
  <meta name="description" content="{{homeDescription}}">
  <title>{{homeTitle}}</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="assets/img/mark.svg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/style.css">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="IngredientCore">
  <meta property="og:title" content="{{homeTitle}}">
  <meta property="og:description" content="{{homeDescription}}">
  <meta property="og:image" content="assets/img/hero-bakery.jpg">
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <div class="topline">
    <div class="container topline__inner">
      <span>{{identity}}</span>
      <a href="mailto:{{email}}">{{email}} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container site-header__inner">
      <a class="brand" href="index.html" aria-label="IngredientCore, home"><img src="assets/img/logo.svg" width="285" height="48" alt="IngredientCore"></a>
      <button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-controls="primary-navigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Open navigation" data-menu-toggle><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
      <nav class="site-nav" id="primary-navigation" aria-label="Main navigation" data-menu>{{navigationHtml}}</nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
      <div class="container hero__grid">
        <div class="hero__copy">
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light"><span class="eyebrow__dot"></span> {{homeEyebrow}}</span>
          <h1 id="hero-heading">{{heroHeadline}}</h1>
          <p class="hero__lead">{{positioning}}</p>
          <div class="hero__actions">
            <a class="button button--cream" href="products/index.html">Explore ingredients <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a class="text-link text-link--light" href="applications/index.html">Browse food applications <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero__footnote"><span class="hero__line"></span> {{homeIdentity}}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__visual">
          <img src="assets/img/hero-bakery.jpg" alt="Assorted bread and pastries on a dark table" width="802" height="578" fetchpriority="high">
          <div class="hero__floating-card">
            <span class="micro-label">FROM FORMULA TO SOURCING</span>
            <span class="floating-card__title">Function <b>→</b> Ingredient <b>→</b> Specification</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero__corner" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__bottom" aria-hidden="true"><span>01 / 04</span><span>Explore the possibilities ↓</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="intro section-pad" aria-labelledby="intro-heading">
      <div class="container intro__grid">
        <div class="section-kicker"><span class="section-kicker__line"></span> THREE PROCUREMENT STARTING POINTS</div>
        <div>
          <h2 id="intro-heading">Product, grade and documents.<br><span class="serif-accent">Define each before sourcing.</span></h2>
          <div class="intro__bottom">
            <p><strong>Start with the food and function.</strong> Use the application guides to frame the selection. <strong>Compare the grade and the evidence.</strong> Learn which records answer your qualification questions. <strong>Put the purchasing requirement in writing.</strong> Prepare an email brief with the product, market and documents you need.</p>
            <a class="round-arrow" href="quality/index.html" aria-label="Read the supply and document review guide">↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="task-paths container" aria-label="Choose a procurement starting point"><a href="products/index.html"><strong>Find a named ingredient</strong><span>Browse core families or search the name and abbreviation.</span></a><a href="applications/index.html"><strong>Start with a food or function</strong><span>Review candidate ingredients and questions for your process.</span></a><a href="quality/index.html#documents"><strong>Review a source and its records</strong><span>Check identities, specifications, batch results and certificate scope.</span></a></section>

    <section class="ingredients section-pad" id="ingredients" aria-labelledby="ingredients-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker"><span class="section-kicker__line"></span> OUR INGREDIENT FOCUS</div>
            <h2 id="ingredients-heading">Core ingredient families.<br><span class="serif-accent">Specific purchasing questions.</span></h2>
          </div>
          <p>Our initial focus covers phosphates, propionates, sorbates, sodium CMC and hydrocolloids. Explore their functions, then specify the exact material, grade and requirements in your inquiry.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ingredient-grid">
          <article class="ingredient-card ingredient-card--featured">
            <div class="ingredient-card__index">01 / PHOSPHATES</div>
            <div class="ingredient-card__visual ingredient-card__visual--phosphate" aria-hidden="true"><span class="molecule molecule--one"></span><span class="molecule molecule--two"></span><span class="molecule molecule--three"></span></div>
            <div class="ingredient-card__body"><h3>Food phosphates</h3><p>Options for water management, buffering, emulsification, leavening and process control.</p><span class="ingredient-card__examples">Sodium · Potassium · Calcium · Blends</span><a class="ingredient-card__link" href="products/index.html#food-phosphates">Explore phosphates <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
          </article>
          <article class="ingredient-card">
            <div class="ingredient-card__index">02 / SHELF-LIFE SUPPORT</div>
            <div class="ingredient-card__symbol" aria-hidden="true">◌</div>
            <div class="ingredient-card__body"><h3>Propionates</h3><p>Preservation options commonly evaluated in bakery and selected prepared-food systems.</p><span class="ingredient-card__examples">Calcium propionate · Sodium propionate</span><a class="ingredient-card__link" href="products/index.html#preservation">Explore preservation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
          </article>
          <article class="ingredient-card">
            <div class="ingredient-card__index">03 / PRESERVATION</div>
            <div class="ingredient-card__symbol ingredient-card__symbol--dots" aria-hidden="true">···</div>
            <div class="ingredient-card__body"><h3>Sorbates</h3><p>Ingredients considered for shelf-life support where the food category and market permit.</p><span class="ingredient-card__examples">Potassium sorbate · Calcium sorbate</span><a class="ingredient-card__link" href="products/potassium-sorbate.html">Explore sorbates <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
          </article>
          <article class="ingredient-card">
            <div class="ingredient-card__index">04 / TEXTURE & STABILITY</div>
            <div class="ingredient-card__symbol ingredient-card__symbol--wave" aria-hidden="true">≈</div>
            <div class="ingredient-card__body"><h3>CMC & hydrocolloids</h3><p>Texture and stability tools for viscosity, suspension, water binding and mouthfeel.</p><span class="ingredient-card__examples">Sodium CMC · Xanthan gum · Carrageenan</span><a class="ingredient-card__link" href="products/index.html#texture-stability">Explore hydrocolloids <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="section-note"><span class="section-note__star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p>Availability, grade and supporting documents must be confirmed for the specific product and proposed source.</p><a href="products/index.html">Browse ingredient guides <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="applications section-pad" id="applications" aria-labelledby="applications-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head section-head--applications">
          <div><div class="section-kicker"><span class="section-kicker__line"></span> START WITH YOUR APPLICATION</div><h2 id="applications-heading">What are you <span class="serif-accent">trying to make better?</span></h2></div>
          <p>The same ingredient can play different roles in different foods. Begin with your process and target outcome.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="application-grid">
          <a href="applications/index.html#meat-seafood" class="application-card application-card--image"><img src="assets/img/seafood.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" width="817" height="518"><div class="application-card__overlay"><span>01 / APPLICATION</span><h3>Meat & seafood</h3><p>Moisture, texture and processing performance.</p></div></a>
          <a href="applications/index.html#bakery" class="application-card application-card--image"><img src="assets/img/hero-bakery.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" width="802" height="578"><div class="application-card__overlay"><span>02 / APPLICATION</span><h3>Bakery</h3><p>Leavening, consistency and shelf-life questions.</p></div></a>
          <a href="applications/index.html#dairy" class="application-card application-card--plain"><span>03 / APPLICATION</span><div class="application-card__illustration" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div><h3>Dairy & dairy alternatives</h3><p>Protein, mineral and hydration questions for texture and stability.</p></div></a>
        </div>
        <p class="applications__more"><a href="applications/index.html">Explore applications <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="approach section-pad" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-heading">
      <div class="container approach__grid">
        <div class="approach__intro"><div class="section-kicker section-kicker--light"><span class="section-kicker__line"></span> BEFORE AN ORDER</div><h2 id="approach-heading">Four points to <span class="serif-accent">agree before sourcing.</span></h2><p>Use these questions to prepare your inquiry and review a proposed offer. Product identity, source and document scope should be considered together.</p><a class="button button--outline" href="quality/index.html">Review supply and document questions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li><span>01</span><div><h3>Define</h3><p>Tell us the food application, target function, destination market and key process conditions.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>02</span><div><h3>Identify</h3><p>Confirm the proposed grade, producer, site and legal seller for the individual offer.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>03</span><div><h3>Review</h3><p>Ask which current specification, sample records and supporting documents apply and can be shared.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>04</span><div><h3>Agree</h3><p>Clarify packaging, quantity, delivery terms, timing and order-specific documentation.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="insights section-pad" id="insights" aria-labelledby="insights-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker"><span class="section-kicker__line"></span> THE INGREDIENT LIBRARY</div><h2 id="insights-heading">Better questions lead to <span class="serif-accent">better choices.</span></h2></div><p>Practical starting points for comparing ingredients and preparing a qualification brief.</p></div>
        <div class="insight-grid">
          <article class="insight-card"><span class="insight-card__number">01</span><span class="insight-card__category">INGREDIENT COMPARISON</span><h3>STPP or SHMP: where should the comparison begin?</h3><p>Look at the target function, food matrix, process conditions and specification before comparing names.</p><a href="knowledge/stpp-vs-shmp.html">Read guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="insight-card"><span class="insight-card__number">02</span><span class="insight-card__category">SHELF-LIFE SELECTION</span><h3>Propionates and sorbates: frame the preservation question</h3><p>Product pH, formulation, process and destination market shape the shortlist.</p><a href="knowledge/propionates-and-sorbates.html">Read guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="insight-card"><span class="insight-card__number">03</span><span class="insight-card__category">BUYER DOCUMENTATION</span><h3>Specification, TDS and COA: what each tells you</h3><p>A useful document package connects the proposed product, its source and the agreed order specification.</p><a href="knowledge/specification-tds-coa.html">Read guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
        </div>
        <p class="insights__more"><a href="knowledge/index.html">Browse buying guides <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about section-pad" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
      <div class="container about__grid">
        <div class="about__mark" aria-hidden="true"><span>C</span><i></i></div>
        <div class="about__copy"><div class="section-kicker"><span class="section-kicker__line"></span> ABOUT INGREDIENTCORE</div><h2 id="about-heading">Established in 2025.<br><span class="serif-accent">Focused on food ingredients.</span></h2><p>{{established}} Our focus is phosphates, propionates, sorbates, sodium CMC and hydrocolloids for food manufacturers and ingredient distributors.</p><p>Tell us about your food application, target function and purchasing requirements. Explore our product information and buying guides, then contact us with your specification and document needs.</p><a class="about__signature" href="about/index.html">Meet IngredientCore <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <div class="container contact__grid">
        <div><div class="section-kicker section-kicker--light"><span class="section-kicker__line"></span> LET'S BEGIN WITH YOUR BRIEF</div><h2 id="contact-heading">Tell us what you are <span class="serif-accent">working on.</span></h2><p>Share your product or target function, application, target specification, expected volume and destination market. Include the records you need for qualification.</p></div>
        <div class="contact__action"><a class="button button--cream" href="contact/index.html">Prepare an ingredient brief <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span>Or call <a href="tel:{{phone}}">{{phoneDisplay}}</a></span></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer__top">
      <div class="footer__brand"><img src="assets/img/logo.svg" width="260" height="44" alt="IngredientCore"><p>{{focus}}</p></div>
      {{footerNavigationHtml}}
      <div class="footer__contact"><h3>Contact</h3><a href="mailto:{{email}}">{{email}}</a><a href="tel:{{phone}}">{{phoneDisplay}}</a><address>{{addressHtml}}</address></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container footer__bottom"><span>© <span data-year>2026</span> IngredientCore. A subsidiary of Bespring Chemical.</span><span>English · Food ingredients</span></div>
  </footer>
  <script src="assets/js/site.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
